        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "7137fab7-a532-5219-ae75-6d2c9c1506a8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Juan Carlos Onetti, Richard Llewellyn, Stanley Baker\n- Works: Para esta noche, Nuit de chien, How Green Was My Valley\n- Organizations: BBC Television\n\nFacts:\n- Juan Carlos Onetti Borges was born on July 1, 1909, in Montevideo and was an Uruguayan novelist and author of short stories.\n- Richard Dafydd Vivian Llewellyn Lloyd was born on December 8, 1906, and was a British novelist known by the pen name Richard Llewellyn.\n- Nuit de chien is based on the novel Para esta noche by Juan Carlos Onetti.\n- How Green Was My Valley is a BBC Television serial based on the novel by Richard Llewellyn.\n- Stanley Baker appeared in How Green Was My Valley in one of his last performances.\n- Richard Llewellyn died on November 30, 1983.\n- Juan Carlos Onetti Borges died on May 30, 1994, in Madrid.",
